seq v=1 rig=screen program=claude build=2.1.0
# T1, T2: a harness approve accepted with no box open waits on the lead; a
# person's key before the box shows is the later input and takes the lead,
# so the box it leads to closes the person's, `passed`, never the act's.
# A control client's input accepted after the person's takes the lead back;
# a person's lead the box opens past binds nothing.
see busy
admit harness act=approve
accept
at 100 person
at 300 see prompt edit
expect open p1 approval par=t1 box=edit at=300
at 400 see busy
expect close p1 approval out=passed by=human at=400
at 1000 person
at 1100 admit ctl act=approve
accept
at 1200 see prompt edit
expect open p2 approval par=t1 box=edit at=1200
at 1300 see busy
expect close p2 approval out=passed by=ctl at=1300
at 2000 person
at 2700 see prompt edit
expect open p3 approval par=t1 box=edit at=2700
see busy
expect close p3 approval out=passed by=- at=2700
